body:
Added an `ArrayForEach` helper which iterates over one or more dimensions of one or more ArrayViews and applies a functor to slices. Elements can be skipped by implementing an optional `ghostFunctor` (in certain instances, this is just an ArrayView of a `ghost` field). The outer-most loop of iteration can be OpenMP parallelised (enabled by default).

Usage instructions are given in Doxygen comments and demonstrated in the test. Ideally, this would be used by the `Field` or `FunctionSpace` class in conjunction with suitable metadata.

